  {
   "id": "anomaly-agent-249084@major-2024-03-28",
   "gameId": "anomaly-agent-249084",
   "displayName": "Anomaly Agent - Free Major Update, Rogue Agent Mode, Available Now!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-03-28T14:02:15.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Anomaly Agent's Roguelike mode, Rogue Agent, is available now!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are thrilled by the interest you've shown in Anomaly Agent. Thanks to your support, we've had the chance to realize one of our dreams.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "After releasing the game, we pondered how we could reciprocate this support. The idea came to us to create an additional mode for the game. We wanted to prepare a challenge mode that players who love the game and enjoy playing it could enter repeatedly and try out. Initially, this challenge mode was going to be about defeating waves of enemies in a simple manner. However, we decided to add some roguelike elements to make it more engaging and take it to a more enjoyable level.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the end, you won't see entirely new things, but you'll notice that the existing elements of the game are presented in a different way.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope it's a mod you'll enjoy playing. Wishing you a lot of fun. Thanks again for your support.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
